{
  "$schema-comment": "Pinned snapshots of public Ember repos that the plugin runs against in ecosystem CI. SHAs are bumped manually for now (a periodic bump workflow can come later). The `include` glob patterns use a small minimatch subset (`**`, `*`, `?`, `{a,b}`) and are evaluated against repo-relative paths; `exclude` is applied first so noise like fixtures, generated dist trees, and node_modules never reaches html-validate. Layouts were verified at the pinned SHAs — when bumping, re-probe the repo if `files: 0` shows up.",
